#: src/ocr/engine.js:25
msgid ""
"The Gradia app is not installed. Select another OCR engine in Settings → OCR "
"& Translation."
msgstr "未安装 Gradia 应用, 请在「设置 → OCR 与翻译」中选择其他 OCR 引擎."

#: src/ocr/engine.js:26
msgid "LLM OCR is disabled. Enable it in Settings → OCR & Translation."
msgstr "LLM OCR 未启用, 请在「设置 → OCR 与翻译」中开启."

#: src/ocr/engine.js:27
msgid ""
"OCR backend is not configured: fill in the base URL and model in Settings → "
"OCR & Translation."
msgstr "OCR 后端未配置: 请在「设置 → OCR 与翻译」中填写 Base URL 和模型名称."

#: src/ocr/engine.js:28
msgid "Cannot read the API key file. Check its path and permissions."
msgstr "无法读取 API key 文件, 请检查路径和权限."

