msgid ""
"The extra body is not valid JSON. Fix it in Settings → OCR & Translation."
msgstr "附加请求体不是合法 JSON, 请在「设置 → OCR 与翻译」中修正."

#: src/ocr/engine.js:30
msgid ""
"The model output was truncated. Disable thinking mode in the extra body "
"({\"thinking\": {\"type\": \"disabled\"}}) or raise max_tokens."
msgstr ""
"模型输出被截断: 可在附加请求体中关闭思考模式 ({\"thinking\": {\"type\": "
"\"disabled\"}}) 或调高 max_tokens."

