#: src/prefs/ocrPage.js:184
msgid ""
"Only the OpenAI compatible /chat/completions protocol is supported. The "
"model must accept image input. Nothing is prefilled. Example: base URL "
"https://api.deepseek.com, model deepseek-flash. Thinking modes add latency: "
"pass {\"thinking\": {\"type\": \"disabled\"}} in the extra body to disable "
"it when the vendor supports it."
msgstr ""
"仅支持 OpenAI 兼容的 /chat/completions 协议, 且模型必须支持图片输入. 不预填任"
"何配置. 示例: Base URL 填 https://api.deepseek.com, 模型填 deepseek-flash. 思"
"考模式会增加延迟: 厂商支持时可在附加请求体中传 {\"thinking\": {\"type\": "
"\"disabled\"}} 关闭."

